{:edb/db-before-t 833 :edb/db-after-t 834 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534146 50 #inst "2026-10-06T04:49:40.858Z" 13194139534146 true] [17592186100599 1100 "Calculate $A-(B-C)$, where\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$" 13194139534146 false] [17592186100599 1100 "Calculate $A-(B-C),$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139534146 true] [17592186100599 1145 "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nA - (B - C) &= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} - (\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix}-1 - 0 & -1 - (-5) \\\\ 2 - 1 & 0 - 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 - (-1) & 0 - 4 \\\\ 2 - 1 & -2 - (-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534146 false] [17592186100599 1145 "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-([\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1-0 & -1-(-5) \\\\ 2-1 & 0-1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1-(-1) & 0-4 \\\\ 2-1 & -2-(-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534146 true] [17592186100600 1100 "Find $A+C-(B+A)$, if\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$" 13194139534146 false] [17592186100600 1100 "Find $A+C-(B+A),$ if\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 